error[E0300]: relation field 'author' on 'Post' was read without the compiler proving its rows were loaded
  --> check_orm_relation_param_no_caller.bit:21:10
   |
21 |   return p.author.name
   |          ^^^^^^^^ 'p' is a parameter of 'touchAuthor', and no function in this project calls 'touchAuthor' (a `test` block is not a caller), so no query's rows ever reach it -- call 'touchAuthor' from a function with rows from a query, which then loads 'author' (or add '.with("author")' to that query)
